<title>USA: Upper Moreland School District, Pa., final details.</title>
<headline>Upper Moreland School District, Pa., final details.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public Financial Management, Inc, financial advisor to the Upper Moreland Township School District, Pa., said it recalculated Mellon Bank's winning true interest cost for the District's $4.995 million general obligation bond sale.  Mellon Bank's winning TIC is 5.1717 percent reflecting the cost of insurance, not the 5.15 percent originally calculated.</p>
